<title>USA: Dawson names Byerlotzer chief oper officer.</title>
<headline>Dawson names Byerlotzer chief oper officer.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dawson Production Services Inc said on Wednesday that it named Jim Byerlotzer senior vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Byerlotzer joined the company after Dawson bought the onshore land operations of Pride Petroleum Services Inc, Dawson said.</p>
<p>Dawson's previous chief operating officer was Joe Eustace, who was named regional vice president of the company's East Texas/Gulf Coast Region, Dawson said.</p>
